# Gitignored for the same reason they must stay out of the build context: the plan names
# hosts and usernames, and the logs carry whatever those runs printed. Dockerfile.test does
# a bare `COPY . .`, so without these the private data ships in the test image.
.validation-matrix.conf
.validation-logs/
